multiple_choice: One of these uses a Nordic cross — the off-centre cross shared across Scandinavia. Which?
![A blue flag with an off-centre yellow cross](data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27300%27%20height%3D%27200%27%20viewBox%3D%270%200%2060%2040%27%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%2760%27%20height%3D%2740%27%20fill%3D%27%23006aa7%27%2F%3E%3Crect%20y%3D%2716%27%20width%3D%2760%27%20height%3D%278%27%20fill%3D%27%23fecc00%27%2F%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%2718%27%20width%3D%278%27%20height%3D%2740%27%20fill%3D%27%23fecc00%27%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E)
